00:10:11,662 --> 00:10:20,164
随着我们探索的模型种类不断增加，结果发现我们很难在其中表达某些类型的模型。
As we expanded the repertoire of kinds of models we were exploring, it
turned out we weren't easily able to express some kinds of models in there.

95
00:10:20,462 --> 00:10:32,964
这就是为什么我们从第一个系统中汲取经验，并构建了 TensorFlow，
使其既能保持可扩展和生产就绪的特性，又能兼顾灵活性和更广泛的通用性。
And so that's why we sort of took what we learned from our first system and built TensorFlow to be scalable and production ready,
retain those attributes, but also be flexible and a little bit more general purpose.

96
00:10:33,936 --> 00:10:46,256
我们在开发 TensorFlow 期间查看的其他一些开源包，虽然在三项属性中表现出好的两项，
但并非全部三项，而且它们在强项上的侧重点各不相同。
other existing open source packages that we looked at around the time we were developing TensorFlow were also good on two of the
three, but not all three, and they differed in which kinds of two of the attributes they were sort of really strong in.

