00:10:47,758 --> 00:10:58,496
因此，我们在 TensorFlow 中的目标是建立一个表达机器学习想法的通用平台，
并希望它能成为全球研究和生产领域最优秀的工具。
And so our goals in TensorFlow were to establish this common platform for expressing machine learning ideas and hopefully make it the
best in the world for both research and production use.

